---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import avatar from "../assets/about.jpeg";
---

<div class={"about"}>
	<div>
		<div class={"image"}>
			<Image src={avatar} alt="avatar" inferSize />
		</div>
	</div>
	<div>
		<div class={"info"}>
			<div class={"name"}>El Bahi<br />BELKHEIRI</div>
		</div>
		<div class={"role"}>
			<div>
				I am a visual artist based in Algeria, specializing in oil
				painting. My work explores the intersection of traditional
				techniques and contemporary expression, capturing the essence of
				human emotion and the beauty of the natural world.
			</div>
			<div style={{ marginTop: ".5rem" }}>
				Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Mauris
				mollis volutpat purus, sed cursus tellus malesuada at. Donec
				laoreet pellentesque velit. Proin accumsan mollis mauris, eget
				posuere orci venenatis ac. Nam congue quam in tortor egestas
				elementum. Suspendisse dui velit, faucibus ac tortor nec, dictum
				dictum dui. Donec gravida vel.
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.about {
		margin-top: 7rem;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.role {
		width: 50%;
		line-height: 1.5;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.image {
		justify-self: end;
	}

	.image > img {
		width: 20rem;
		height: auto;
	}

	.name {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.role {
		font-size: 1rem;
	}
</style>
